    <!-- Editorial Prose -->
    <div class="article-content">
      <p style="font-size: 1.25rem;">So, you have booked your flights and are wondering: <em>"What is a good itinerary for a 10-day trip in Morocco?"</em> Whether you are searching for a <strong>Morocco road trip 10 days</strong> route, or the classic <strong>10 day itinerary from Marrakech to Fes</strong>, you have landed in exactly the right place.</p>
  
      <p>Morocco is a country of staggering contrasts. In just ten days, you can wander the car-free, medieval medina of Fes, cross the snow-capped High Atlas Mountains, and ride a camel into the shifting sand dunes of the Sahara Desert. This guide outlines our absolute favorite <strong>Morocco 10-day itinerary</strong>.</p>

